<section id="S5.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Results: Reasoning Quality.</h4>

<div id="S5.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the reasoning evaluation results in Table <a href="#S5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Results: Reasoning Quality. ‣ 5.1 Comparative Study ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ Self-Exploring Language Models for Explainable Link Forecasting on Temporal Graphs via Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. The comparison</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:37%;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="S5.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Results on the quality of reasoning traces.</span></figcaption>
